{"seq":12,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/qm-pi-haiku-gbrain-told-live-mu-memory/ms-08-saltmarsh-summary/r2","wall_ts":"2026-10-27T00:29:39.427Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"8fef1f2010abb7a1432bd31e19eb531afaed6ebbe64e4df801883b59f38d7235","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","text":"@Sofia Marchetti, here is what the channel history and Moss's notes show. I could not confirm the new owner.\n\n1. **Who took over and when:** I can't confirm the new owner. Moss's 5 Oct 2025 note says Saltmarsh Provisions \"changes hands tomorrow, Monday, October 6,\" but it doesn't name who received the account. The May 2026 digest doesn't mention Saltmarsh either. Please check the CRM or ask Ruth Calloway for the new owner's name before you write it into the file.\n2. **Discount after the November correction:** 10%. On 17 Nov 2025 Bettina first posted 12%, then retracted it the same afternoon, saying it was 10% and that she had misread June Osei-Lark's draft worksheet. Moss's cheat sheet also gives 10% as the threshold above which Anselm Grieve must approve.\n3. **Ticket for Corinne's admin access issue:** PD-4827. Kwame Adjei-Rowe opened it on 15 Oct 2025 for the lost admin rights in Pemberline Dock. Don't confuse it with PD-4824, which Moss's notes list as the door 3 to door 4 move question."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","ts":"1791986400.000124"}}
